    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "On March 20, 2025, BBXToken was exploited on BNB Chain through repeated liquidity pool manipulations, resulting in a loss of approximately $12,000. The attacker abused the token's transfer burn mechanism, repeatedly invoking transfers to artificially skew PancakeSwap reserves and then swapped against the manipulated price. BBXToken's _transfer() function burns tokens from the LP with every transfer,including zero-amount transfers,then forcibly syncs PancakeSwap reserves. This allowed attackers to repeatedly drain and skew the pool, manipulating the spot price and extracting value."
